sentences.text:
The impugned order is assailed inter alia on the ground that the Ld. AO/ADM she was denied and not afforded with an opportunity of fair hearing; and that Analyst Report dated 27.01.2020 was supplied to her vide letter bearing no. F.121(24)/DO Central/FS/2020/12340 dated 04.02.2020;
and that no opportunity was given to her for sending the 4th packet for analysis to a NADL accredited laboratory in terms of Section 47(1)(c)(3) of FSS Act; and that in any case as per Regulation 2.4.5 of Act, there was a mandate upon the FSO to send the sample to a NADL accredited laboratory, which was not done; and that the FSO failed to specify as to how much quantity of the food item was sent to the Food Analyst and the opinion of Ld. AO of declaring the food item as misbranded under various FSS (P&L) Regulations was given in a mechanical and arbitrary manner.
